<p>First off, I would like to state that this was a collab between me and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/floppyphoenix" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1735419); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1735419&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1561564755" alt="FloppyPhoenix" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1735419)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/floppyphoenix" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1735419); return false;">FloppyPhoenix</a></span>.</p>
<p>I could not do this without her, so props.</p>
<p>Anyway, onto the critters. This page was critiqued by: <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/fieldstone" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1436137); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1436137&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1561564755" alt="fieldstone" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1436137)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/fieldstone" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1436137); return false;">fieldstone</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yossileiner" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2199269); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2199269&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1561564755" alt="YossiLeiner" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2199269)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yossileiner" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2199269); return false;">YossiLeiner</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/westrin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2858989); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2858989&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1561564755" alt="Westrin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2858989)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/westrin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2858989); return false;">Westrin</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ma-kir" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3781657); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3781657&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1561564755" alt="Ma_Kir" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3781657)" /></a><a href="http://w