<p>Co-author here! This was a fun article to write. <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/phamtomguy" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3187915); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3187915&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1594674569" alt="PhamtomGuy" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3187915)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/phamtomguy" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3187915); return false;">PhamtomGuy</a></span> initially came to me with most of the ideas and brainstorming behind this scip and I'm glad we were able to work together to turn it into something nice.</p>
<hr />
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▶&nbsp;Additional&nbsp;Information</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<ol>
<li>This is inspired by <strong><a target="_blank" href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/operation-overmeta">the Pataphysics Department</a></strong> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rimple" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2320004); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2320004&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1594674569" alt="Rimple" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2320004)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rimple" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2320004); return false;">Rimple</a></span>.</li>
<li>The Researcher notes in Addendum 3 are not the end of the article; keep scrolling down to find the rest.
<ul>
<li><strong>NOTE:</strong> The &quot;New Post&quot; section <em>is</em> functional and allows you to type into its text box. This does not work on most mobile browsers and select desktop browsers. If it fails to work, pressing space may work.</li>
<li>The HTML code for Addendum 3's &quot;Forum thread&quot; is adapted from <strong><a target="_blank" href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/coolpage-funpage">coolpage funpage</a></strong> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stephlynch" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1802367); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1802367&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1594674569" alt="stephlynch" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1802367)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stephlynch" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1802367); return false;">stephlynch</a></span>. <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/westrin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2858989); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2858989&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1594674569" alt="Westrin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2858989)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/westrin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2858989); return false;">Westrin</a></span> helped with necessary modifications to adapt it for this article.</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Each collapsible's text is an easter egg, referencing Il'gynoth from World of Warcraft.</li>
<li>We received permission from both <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/westrin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2858989); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2858989&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1594674569" alt="Westrin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2858989)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/westrin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2858989); return false;">Westrin</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1404533); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1404533&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1594674569" alt="Zyn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1404533)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1404533); return false;">Zyn</a></span> to use their likenesses in this article. References to the SCP Wiki Forums and Senior Staff procedures are not there to mock or make fun. They exist to take this meta-story to its logical conclusion.</li>
<li>We're aware that meta articles are typically controversial in nature &#8212; I'm personally not the biggest fan of meta myself &#8212; but wanted to try writing one anyway.</li>
